      "statement": "The risk appetite framework sets CET1 limits of at least 13.0% for the baseline Standardized ratio (15.08% at Dec 2025) and at least 10.2% for the minimum stressed ratio under the internal severely adverse scenario (12.6% at Dec 2025).",
