      "statement": "MDL-CAP-003 rolls CET1 capital forward quarterly over nine quarters (Q3 2026 to Q3 2028) as prior capital plus net income minus preferred and common dividends and buybacks plus other movements, rolls RWA forward by a growth rate, and computes the ratio as capital over RWA; starting capital and RWA come from API-16 and scenario paths from API-14.",
